      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The article discusses diagnostic difficulties in acute abdominal pain. The author adduces data on the frequency of diagnostic errors in diagnostics of coronary heart disease (CHD) before admission and in the admission department of an urgent aid hospital. The analysis of the causes of delayed diagnosis in patients with CHD and acute myocardial infarction is exemplified with 3 clinical observations. The article also covers ways of prevention of diagnostic errors in patients with abdominal pain."},
